{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1628","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Grid Xor"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note: The XOR-sum of set $$$\\{s_1,s_2,\\ldots,s_m\\}$$$ is defined as $$$s_1 \\oplus s_2 \\oplus \\ldots \\oplus s_m$$$, where $$$\\oplus$$$ denotes the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#XOR"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise XOR operation"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After almost winning IOI, Victor bought himself an $$$n\\times n$$$ grid containing integers in each cell. "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$n$$$ is an even integer."}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" The integer in the cell in the $$$i$$$-th row and $$$j$$$-th column is $$$a_{i,j}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Sadly, Mihai stole the grid from Victor and told him he would return it with only one condition: Victor has to tell Mihai the XOR-sum of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"all"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" the integers in the whole grid."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Victor doesn't remember all the elements of the grid, but he remembers some information about it: For each cell, Victor remembers the XOR-sum of all its neighboring cells."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Two cells are considered neighbors if they share an edge — in other words, for some integers $$$1 \\le i, j, k, l \\le n$$$, the cell in the $$$i$$$-th row and $$$j$$$-th column is a neighbor of the cell in the $$$k$$$-th row and $$$l$$$-th column if $$$|i - k| = 1$$$ and $$$j = l$$$, or if $$$i = k$$$ and $$$|j - l| = 1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To get his grid back, Victor is asking you for your help. Can you use the information Victor remembers to find the XOR-sum of the whole grid?"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It can be proven that the answer is unique."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 100$$$) — the number of test cases. The description of test cases follows."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains a single "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"even"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2 \\leq n \\leq 1000$$$) — the size of the grid."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then follows $$$n$$$ lines, each containing $$$n$$$ integers. The $$$j$$$-th integer in the $$$i$$$-th of these lines represents the XOR-sum of the integers in all the neighbors of the cell in the $$$i$$$-th row and $$$j$$$-th column."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases doesn't exceed $$$1000$$$ and in the original grid $$$0 \\leq a_{i, j} \\leq 2^{30} - 1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Hack Format"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To hack a solution, use the following format:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line should contain a single integer t ($$$1 \\le t \\le 100$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case should contain a single "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"even"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2 \\leq n \\leq 1000$$$) — the size of the grid."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then $$$n$$$ lines should follow, each containing $$$n$$$ integers. The $$$j$$$-th integer in the $$$i$$$-th of these lines is $$$a_{i,j}$$$ in Victor's "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"original"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" grid. The values in the grid should be integers in the range $$$[0, 2^{30}-1]$$$"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases must not exceed $$$1000$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output a single integer — the XOR-sum of the whole grid."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n2\n1 5\n5 1\n4\n1 14 8 9\n3 1 5 9\n4 13 11 1\n1 15 4 11\n4\n2 4 1 6\n3 7 3 10\n15 9 4 2\n12 7 15 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n9\n5\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"ki